          "text": {
            "zh": "长分组切出小标题（文字 / 页面 / 阅读 / 导出与链接 / 目录 / 排查），图标改双列排、引擎卡补上图标，一屏之内更好找。",
            "en": "Long sections are split into subheadings, icons laid out two per row and engine cards given icons, so everything is easier to find at a glance."
          }
