        {
          "domain": { "zh": "按意思搜", "en": "Search by meaning" },
          "text": {
            "zh": "搜之前先用 AI 把你那句口语压成检索词，去掉问句壳，向量更准；字面通道仍用原话，书名、年份、引文不丢。",
            "en": "Before searching, AI compresses your spoken question into tight keywords for a more accurate vector, while the literal channel still uses your original words."
          },
          "issue": 2
        }
      ],
